{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_01",
      "hash": "1fbce5f2fab397f0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……你果然来了！\\n其实我早有预感！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_06",
      "hash": "1fbcecf2fab3a3d5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "自打我随手把汤匙一扔\\n就让它弯曲的那一天起……\\r\\n我，就成为了一个超能力少女。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_07",
      "hash": "1fbcebf2fab3a222",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "虽然我不喜欢战斗，\\n但既然你这么希望了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_08",
      "hash": "1fbceef2fab3a73b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我便让你\\n见识一下我的力量！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_06_02",
      "hash": "76d3c84d70ea30bd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_02",
      "hash": "1fbce8f2fab39d09",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "为了证明你的胜利，\\n这枚金色徽章就送给你了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8040_sys_01",
      "hash": "659e0516ed84877e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从娜姿那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]金色徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_03",
      "hash": "1fbce7f2fab39b56",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了金色徽章，\\n就算是别人送你的宝可梦，\\r\\n只要等级在[VAR NUM2(0004)]以内，\\r\\n它们都会乖乖听话！\\c\\n还有……！\\n请你拿好这个招式学习器。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8040_sys_02",
      "hash": "659e0416ed8485cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从娜姿那里\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n“[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_04",
      "hash": "1fbceaf2fab3a06f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式学习器33是“冥想”！\\n它可以通过静心凝神\\r\\n来提高自己的特攻和特防！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8040_esper_05",
      "hash": "1fbce9f2fab39ebc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "超能力并不是\\n只属于特定人物的能力！\\r\\n无论是谁都拥有超能力！\\r\\n他们只是没有意识到而已。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_06_07",
      "hash": "76d3c34d70ea283e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 11]"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8040_max",
